## Lessons & Notes
- Extracting `DocumentPreviewDrawer.vue` into `resources/js/Components/` allowed seamless reuse across both Program Accreditation and Common Documents without duplicating drawer logic.
- Providing an inline streaming route (`/documents/{document}/file`) paired with `DocumentStorageService::getTemporaryUrl` ensures consistent PDF rendering in local development and production S3 environments.
- Using `vue-pdf-embed` inside a separate `PdfViewer.vue` component keeps file sizes under the 150-200 line cap and prevents Chromium GPU compositing glitches during slide-out transitions.
